---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Research | Jian Liu" description="Research interests of Jian Liu." activePath="/research">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-kicker">RESEARCH / 01</p>
      <h1 data-en="Research interests" data-zh="研究方向">Research interests</h1>
      <p class="page-lead" data-en="I work across computational biology and AI for Science, with an emphasis on reliable methods, reproducible evaluation, and meaningful scientific applications." data-zh="我的研究兴趣横跨计算生物学与科学人工智能，重点关注可靠的方法、可复现的评估，以及有实际意义的科学应用。">I work across computational biology and AI for Science, with an emphasis on reliable methods, reproducible evaluation, and meaningful scientific applications.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block page-content">
    <div class="container research-list">
      <article class="research-item" id="ai-for-science">
        <div class="research-index">01</div>
        <div class="research-body">
          <p class="section-kicker">AI FOR SCIENCE</p>
          <h2 data-en="Scientific agents and intelligent research workflows" data-zh="科学智能体与智能科研工作流">Scientific agents and intelligent research workflows</h2>
          <p data-en="Exploring how AI agents can plan and execute scientific tasks, use domain-specific tools, retrieve evidence, and communicate uncertainty. A central question is how to make agentic research workflows useful, inspectable, and dependable." data-zh="探索 AI 智能体如何规划并执行科学任务、使用领域工具、检索证据并表达不确定性。核心问题是如何让智能科研工作流真正有用、可检查且值得信赖。">Exploring how AI agents can plan and execute scientific tasks, use domain-specific tools, retrieve evidence, and communicate uncertainty. A central question is how to make agentic research workflows useful, inspectable, and dependable.</p>
          <div class="tag-row"><span>AI Agents</span><span>Tool Use</span><span>Evidence-grounded Reasoning</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="research-item" id="scientific-software">
        <div class="research-index">02</div>
        <div class="research-body">
          <p class="section-kicker">SCIENTIFIC SOFTWARE & BENCHMARKING</p>
          <h2 data-en="Evaluating interfaces for scientific software" data-zh="科研软件交互方式与基准评测">Evaluating interfaces for scientific software</h2>
          <p data-en="Studying when graphical user interfaces are necessary, when structured interfaces are sufficient, and how hybrid GUI–API workflows should be evaluated across real scientific applications." data-zh="研究图形用户界面在何种任务中不可替代、结构化接口在何种情况下足够，以及如何在真实科研软件中评估 GUI 与 API 的混合工作流。">Studying when graphical user interfaces are necessary, when structured interfaces are sufficient, and how hybrid GUI–API workflows should be evaluated across real scientific applications.</p>
          <div class="tag-row"><span>GUI</span><span>MCP</span><span>Benchmark Design</span><span>Reproducibility</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="research-item" id="computational-biology">
        <div class="research-index">03</div>
        <div class="research-body">
          <p class="section-kicker">COMPUTATIONAL BIOLOGY</p>
          <h2 data-en="Computational oncology and digital pathology" data-zh="计算肿瘤学与数字病理">Computational oncology and digital pathology</h2>
          <p data-en="Applying bioinformatics, transcriptomic analysis, single-cell methods, and computational pathology to investigate tumor biology and the relationship between tissue morphology and molecular programs." data-zh="运用生物信息学、转录组分析、单细胞方法与计算病理学，研究肿瘤生物学，以及组织形态与分子程序之间的联系。">Applying bioinformatics, transcriptomic analysis, single-cell methods, and computational pathology to investigate tumor biology and the relationship between tissue morphology and molecular programs.</p>
          <div class="tag-row"><span>Bioinformatics</span><span>Single-cell Analysis</span><span>Digital Pathology</span><span>CRC</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing-section">
    <div class="container closing-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">COLLABORATION</p>
      <h2 data-en="Good science is built together." data-zh="好的科学研究，来自开放合作。">Good science is built together.</h2>
      <p data-en="I am open to thoughtful discussions and collaborations across these areas." data-zh="欢迎围绕上述方向开展深入交流与合作。">I am open to thoughtful discussions and collaborations across these areas.</p>
      <a class="button button-light" href="/contact"><span data-en="Get in touch" data-zh="联系交流">Get in touch</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
